{"place_name":"韓","place_name_jianti_auto":"韩","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"8beb0adb-db0e-11ef-9f35-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"成皋","place_name_jianti_auto":"成皋","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"8beb0adc-db0e-11ef-a27a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄭","place_name_jianti_auto":"郑","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"8beb0add-db0e-11ef-8fc9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蔡","place_name_jianti_auto":"蔡","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ade-db0e-11ef-b736-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"8beb0adf-db0e-11ef-85e4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄭","place_name_jianti_auto":"郑","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ae0-db0e-11ef-93f7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":77,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ae1-db0e-11ef-8f12-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"皋狼","place_name_jianti_auto":"皋狼","start_index":81,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ae2-db0e-11ef-a740-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蔡","place_name_jianti_auto":"蔡","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ae3-db0e-11ef-9db5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西河郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"西河郡","start_index":102,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ae4-db0e-11ef-aa8c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"皋狼縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"皋狼县","start_index":106,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ae5-db0e-11ef-813a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"藺縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"蔺县","start_index":112,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ae6-db0e-11ef-91a7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":115,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ae7-db0e-11ef-8c30-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西河","place_name_jianti_auto":"西河","start_index":117,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ae8-db0e-11ef-bec7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"春秋","place_name_jianti_auto":"春秋","start_index":120,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ae9-db0e-11ef-9b59-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"8beb0aea-db0e-11ef-a757-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"康曰：皋，姑勞切；狼，盧當切；春秋蔡地，後爲趙邑。余據春秋之時，晉、楚爭盟，晉不能越鄭而服蔡。三家分晉，韓得成皋，因以幷鄭，時蔡已爲楚所滅，鄭之南境亦入于楚，就使皋狼爲蔡地，趙襄子安得而有之！漢書·地理志西河郡有皋狼縣，又有藺縣。漢之西河，春秋以來皆爲晉境，而古文「藺」字與「蔡」字近，或者「蔡」字其「藺」字之訛也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"康曰：皋，姑劳切；狼，卢当切；春秋蔡地，后为赵邑。余据春秋之时，晋、楚争盟，晋不能越郑而服蔡。三家分晋，韩得成皋，因以幷郑，时蔡已为楚所灭，郑之南境亦入于楚，就使皋狼为蔡地，赵襄子安得而有之！汉书·地理志西河郡有皋狼县，又有蔺县。汉之西河，春秋以来皆为晋境，而古文「蔺」字与「蔡」字近，或者「蔡」字其「蔺」字之讹也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8beb0ace-db0e-11ef-ba7a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"辛伯","people_name_jianti_auto":"辛伯","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8beb0aef-db0e-11ef-bb52-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8beb0af0-db0e-11ef-b61c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陸德明","people_name_jianti_auto":"陆德明","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8beb0af1-db0e-11ef-ae34-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"顏師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"颜师古","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"8beb0af2-db0e-11ef-a162-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"崔豹","people_name_jianti_auto":"崔豹","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8beb0af3-db0e-11ef-9461-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鯀","people_name_jianti_auto":"鲧","start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"8beb0af4-db0e-11ef-8b6c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"長子縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"长子县","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8beb0af5-db0e-11ef-ab46-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8beb0af6-db0e-11ef-8ab5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上黨郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"上党郡","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8beb0af7-db0e-11ef-81b7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"從，才用翻。長子縣，周史辛伯所封邑。班志屬上黨郡。陸德明曰：長子之長，丁丈翻。顏師古曰：長，讀爲短長之長；今讀爲長幼之長，非也。崔豹古今註曰：城，盛也，所以盛受民物也。淮南子曰：鯀作城。盛，時征翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"从，才用翻。长子县，周史辛伯所封邑。班志属上党郡。陆德明曰：长子之长，丁丈翻。颜师古曰：长，读为短长之长；今读为长幼之长，非也。崔豹古今注曰：城，盛也，所以盛受民物也。淮南子曰：鲧作城。盛，时征翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8beb0aee-db0e-11ef-9f16-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"韋昭","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦昭","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8beb0afd-db0e-11ef-a494-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"韋昭曰：謂誰與我同力也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"韦昭曰：谓谁与我同力也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"8beb0afc-db0e-11ef-95fb-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"邯鄲午","people_name_jianti_auto":"邯郸午","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8beb0aff-db0e-11ef-a8f7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8beb0b00-db0e-11ef-9bbf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張晏","people_name_jianti_auto":"张晏","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8beb0b01-db0e-11ef-a3e1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宋白","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋白","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"8beb0b02-db0e-11ef-9734-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"趙敬侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵敬侯","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"8beb0b03-db0e-11ef-a273-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周安王","people_name_jianti_auto":"周安王","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"8beb0b04-db0e-11ef-bd6c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"趙敬侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵敬侯","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"8beb0b05-db0e-11ef-9d4e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"烈王","people_name_jianti_auto":"烈王","start_index":107,"tongjian_id":"8beb0b06-db0e-11ef-85e5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"趙成侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵成侯","start_index":113,"tongjian_id":"8beb0b07-db0e-11ef-b1bf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"成侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"成侯","start_index":120,"tongjian_id":"8beb0b08-db0e-11ef-9ffd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"顯王","peopl